L57: Figure 2 Time to exhaustion at 80%  V ˙ O 2 max during four different trials. PLA: placebo; PLA+C: placebo plus caffeine; BR: beetroot; BR+C: beetroot plus caffeine. Data are expressed as mean ± SD.
